{"sha": "21f5bb60aa5726c5c954c310eba640d10b1352309395a6a9408ca39cfa3f07b5", "body": ["\\chapter{酸、碱与 pH}\\label{ch:g9:acids-bases-ph}", "", "厨房的架子上放着一个柠檬、一瓶醋、一块肥皂和一盒小苏打；", "水槽下面放着一瓶管道疏通剂，瓶身贴着黑红两色的警示标签。", "这些东西中，有的尝起来发酸，有的摸上去滑溜，", "有的还会灼伤皮肤。一把编号从 0 到 14 的标尺，就能将它们全部分类 ---", "同一把标尺，还用于测量游泳池、花园土壤、", "血液和海洋。", "", "\\begin{recall}", "离子是带电荷的原子或原子团；阳离子如 \\ce{Na+} 带正电，", "阴离子如 \\ce{Cl-} 或 \\ce{OH-} 带负电。", "离子溶液中含有标注 (aq) 的离子，这些离子能自由移动", "（见\\cref{ch:g9:ions}）。", "\\end{recall}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.55\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g9-kitchen-shelf.jpg}", "", "{\\small 柠檬、醋、肥皂和小苏打：厨房里的", "酸和碱。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{酸性、碱性和中性溶液}", "", "\\begin{definition}[酸性、碱性和中性溶液]\\label{def:g9:acids-bases-ph:acidic}", "任何水溶液中都含有氢离子 \\ce{H+(aq)}", "和氢氧根离子 \\ce{OH-(aq)}。", "若溶液中 \\ce{H+} 离子比 \\ce{OH-} 离子多，则称为", "\\emph{酸性溶液}\\index{酸性溶液}；若 \\ce{OH-} 离子比 \\ce{H+} 离子多，", "则称为\\emph{碱性溶液}\\index{碱性溶液}；若两种离子数目相等，", "则称为\\emph{中性溶液}\\index{中性溶液}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[三种溶液]\\label{ex:g9:acids-bases-ph:three}", "盐酸是酸性溶液，其中含有 \\ce{H+(aq)} 和 \\ce{Cl-(aq)} 离子，", "\\ce{OH-} 离子则极少。氢氧化钠溶液是碱性溶液，", "含有 \\ce{Na+(aq)} 和 \\ce{OH-(aq)} 离子，而 \\ce{H+} 离子极少。", "纯水和盐水都是中性的。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{pH 标度}", "", "\\begin{definition}[pH]\\label{def:g9:acids-bases-ph:ph}", "水溶液的 \\emph{pH}\\index{pH} 是一个数，通常在 0 到 14 之间，", "用来表示溶液的酸碱程度：在 \\qty{25}{\\celsius} 时，中性溶液的 pH 为 7，", "酸性溶液的 pH 低于 7，碱性溶液的 pH 高于 7。", "溶液所含的 \\ce{H+} 离子越多，", "其 pH 就越低。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=0.95cm]", "  \\foreach \\k in {0,...,13} {", "    \\pgfmathtruncatemacro\\rr{2.2*max(0,100-14.3*\\k)+30}", "    \\pgfmathtruncatemacro\\gg{1.8*(\\k<7 ? 30+10*\\k : 100-8*(\\k-7))+40}", "    \\pgfmathtruncatemacro\\bb{2.2*max(0,14.3*(\\k-6))+30}", "    \\definecolor{phc}{RGB}{\\rr,\\gg,\\bb}", "    \\fill[phc] (\\k,0) rectangle ++(1,0.6);", "  }", "  \\foreach \\k in {0,...,14} \\node[anchor=north, font=\\footnotesize] at (\\k,-0.02) {\\k};", "  \\draw[black!60] (0,0) rectangle (14,0.6);", "  \\node[anchor=south] at (3.5,0.65) {酸性};", "  \\node[anchor=south] at (7,0.65) {中性};", "  \\node[anchor=south] at (10.5,0.65) {碱性};", "  % ledger: ph:HCl-1M, ph:gastric, ph:lime, ph:wine, ph:coffee, ph:pure-water, ph:seawater, ph:milk-magnesia, ph:ammonia, ph:NaOH-1M", "  \\foreach \\x/\\lab/\\lev/\\anc in {0/{hydrochloric\\\\ acid (1 M)}/1/north, 1.5/{gastric\\\\ juices}/3/north east,", "      2/{lime\\\\ juice}/2/north west, 3.5/{wine}/1/north, 5/{coffee}/2/north, 7/{pure\\\\ water}/3/north,", "      8.1/{sea\\\\ water}/1/north, 10.5/{milk of\\\\ magnesia}/3/north, 12/{household\\\\ ammonia}/1/north,", "      14/{sodium hydroxide\\\\ (1 M)}/2/north east} {", "    \\draw[black!55] (\\x,-0.45) -- (\\x,-0.45-0.8*\\lev);", "    \\node[anchor=\\anc, font=\\footnotesize, align=center, inner sep=2pt] at (\\x,-0.45-0.8*\\lev) {\\lab};", "  }", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small pH 标度，以及一些常见溶液的 pH。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[pH 试纸和 pH 计]\\label{def:g9:acids-bases-ph:ph-paper}", "\\emph{pH 试纸}\\index{pH 试纸}是一条浸有混合染料的纸，", "在不同 pH 下呈现不同颜色；将一滴溶液滴在试纸上，", "再把颜色与盒上印着的比色卡对照。", "\\emph{pH 计}\\index{pH 计}用插入溶液中的玻璃探头测量 pH，", "以数字形式显示结果，", "可精确到小数点后一位或两位。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{method}[用 pH 试纸测量 pH]\\label{met:g9:acids-bases-ph:paper}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 取一小条 pH 试纸放在干净、干燥的表面皿上。", "  \\item 用干净的玻璃棒将一滴溶液", "        点在试纸上（切勿把试纸浸入试剂瓶中）。", "  \\item 立即将颜色与比色卡对照，读出", "        pH，通常精确到最接近的整数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=1.2]", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {stirrer};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0.05) {beaker={0.55}{omWater!80}};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0.25,0.35) {probe};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (2.6,3.4) {meter={pH}};", "  \\draw[black!70, line width=0.6pt] (0.25,3.45) .. controls (0.3,4.3) and (2.2,4.4)", "    .. (2.2,2.95);", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (0.4,1.0) -- (2.0,1.3) node[right, text=black] {玻璃探头};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (3.35,3.4) -- (4.0,3.4) node[right, text=black] {pH 计};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (-0.6,0.6) -- (-1.6,0.9) node[left, text=black] {溶液};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}